  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tQuick Guides: Getting Started with Capium\n\n### MyAdmin: Recent Changes and Updates\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 30 Dec, 2024 at  2:12 PM\n\n\t\tVideo: Recent changes in Myadmin\n\nNavigation: My Admin > Firm Details\n\nWhen you start working on Capium for the first time, it is essential to complete the mandatory information in the Firm Details section. Below is a guide to the fields you’ll need to fill out, including recent changes and updates.\n\nClient ID\n\nClient Type\n\nSelect Contact (The Key Contact for the company for all automated communication)\n\nSelect User\n\nName (Name of the client (entity)\n\nPrimary Email \n\nSecondary Email (New)\n\nPhone number\n\nAddresses (Registered Office, Trading, and Overseas) (New)\n\nBusiness start date\n\nBook start date\n\nYear End \n\nRegistration number\n\nUTR number\n\nVAT scheme \n\nVAT registration number\n\nVAT registration date\n\nVAT Submit Type\n\nAccount Office Reference Number\n\nPAYE Reference Number \n\nSIC Codes (New)\n\nSummary of Recent Changes:\n\nSecondary Email - You can now add an additional email address for each client. \n\nAddresses - You can now add multiple address types; Registered Office, Trading Address and Overseas Address.\n\nSIC Codes - By entering the Companies House Reference Number, the system will automatically fetch the Company codes. These codes can also link with the Company Secretarial module and all addresses (Registered Office, Trading, and Overseas) are synced automatically. \n\nIf you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
