=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"521\" dir=\"ltr\">Addresses -&nbsp;</strong>You can now add multiple address types; Registered Office, Trading Address and Overseas Address.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"523\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"524\"><span data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"526\">SIC Codes -</strong> By entering the Companies House Reference Number, the system will automatically fetch the Company codes. These codes can also link with the Company Secretarial module and all addresses (Registered Office, Trading, and Overseas) are synced automatically.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"527\"><br data-identifyelement=\"528\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"529\"><br data-identifyelement=\"530\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"531\"><br data-identifyelement=\"532\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"533\"><br data-identifyelement=\"534\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"535\"><span data-identifyelement=\"536\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">If you encounter any issues or require further assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to your account manager.</span></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000258775\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000258775/thumbs_up\